                "Additional_Manufacturing_Processes_Description": "Specimen has a complex cap and neck geometry, generally a cylinder, where the top layer of cold sprayed deposit has a diameter of 1 inch and a thickness of 0.35 in, and the substrate has a diameter of 1.5 in and there is a thinner cylinder between the substrate and the deposit where the materials meet. For the deposit parameters, 'The rotational speed and robot transverse were adjusted such that the relative velocity was equal to that of a typical raster cold spray pattern'"
